# expect.stdout: 111\n
# expect.exit: 0
project F64LeGeNe
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32
operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Exercise math.lessThanOrEqualF64, math.greaterThanOrEqualF64, and math.notEqualF64. Compose three booleans into a 3-digit binary-as-int: 1.0 <= 2.0 (true), 3.0 >= 2.0 (true), 1.0 != 2.0 (true)."
invariant operation main "Each comparison contributes one decimal digit (100, 10, 1) when true."
label startMain
storage module immutable oneFloat CFloat64 1.0
storage module immutable twoFloat CFloat64 2.0
storage module immutable threeFloat CFloat64 3.0
storage module immutable differentFloat CFloat64 2.0
call leCheckCall math.lessThanOrEqualF64
argument leCheckCall left CFloat64 oneFloat
argument leCheckCall right CFloat64 twoFloat
run leCheckCall
bind value leResult Bool leCheckCall
call geCheckCall math.greaterThanOrEqualF64
argument geCheckCall left CFloat64 threeFloat
argument geCheckCall right CFloat64 twoFloat
run geCheckCall
bind value geResult Bool geCheckCall
call neCheckCall math.notEqualF64
argument neCheckCall left CFloat64 oneFloat
argument neCheckCall right CFloat64 differentFloat
run neCheckCall
bind value neResult Bool neCheckCall
memory main mutable hundredsDigit I64 0
branch if condition leResult target addHundreds
branch else target maybeTens
label addHundreds
storage module immutable oneHundred I64 100
set memory hundredsDigit oneHundred
jump target maybeTens
label maybeTens
memory main mutable tensDigit I64 0
branch if condition geResult target addTens
branch else target maybeOnes
label addTens
storage module immutable ten I64 10
set memory tensDigit ten
jump target maybeOnes
label maybeOnes
memory main mutable onesDigit I64 0
branch if condition neResult target addOnes
branch else target composeTotal
label addOnes
storage module immutable oneUnit I64 1
set memory onesDigit oneUnit
jump target composeTotal
label composeTotal
call sumHTCall math.addI64
argument sumHTCall left I64 hundredsDigit
argument sumHTCall right I64 tensDigit
run sumHTCall
bind value partialHT I64 sumHTCall
call sumAllCall math.addI64
argument sumAllCall left I64 partialHT
argument sumAllCall right I64 onesDigit
run sumAllCall
bind value composedTotal I64 sumAllCall
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value I64 composedTotal
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
